{"duration": 68.495, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A steel tank burst and a wall of syrup swallowed a Boston street.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.284}, {"beat": 0, "text": "People in the North End heard a roar like an elevated train.", "start": 3.504, "end": 6.629}, {"beat": 1, "text": "It was January 15, 1919.", "start": 7.049, "end": 9.173}, {"beat": 1, "text": "That tank held 2.3 million gallons of molasses.", "start": 9.393, "end": 12.208}, {"beat": 1, "text": "It stood 50 feet tall and 90 feet wide.", "start": 12.428, "end": 14.826}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The tank collapsed at about 12:30 in the afternoon.", "start": 15.246, "end": 18.058}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Rivets shot out like machine gun fire.", "start": 18.278, "end": 20.293}, {"beat": 2, "text": "A wave of molasses 25 feet high raced through the streets.", "start": 20.513, "end": 24.065}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It moved at 35 miles per hour.", "start": 24.485, "end": 26.386}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It swept buildings off their foundations.", "start": 26.606, "end": 28.487}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It tipped a streetcar off its tracks.", "start": 28.707, "end": 30.417}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It picked up a truck and threw it into the harbor.", "start": 30.637, "end": 32.785}, {"beat": 3, "text": "The molasses killed 21 people and injured 150.", "start": 33.005, "end": 36.549}, {"beat": 4, "text": "You see, molasses is 40% denser than water.", "start": 36.969, "end": 39.733}, {"beat": 4, "text": "It's like trying to swim through warm honey that gets thicker as you struggle.", "start": 39.953, "end": 43.646}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The real reason: the day before, a ship delivered warm molasses.", "start": 44.066, "end": 47.707}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That warm molasses thinned the older, colder molasses already inside.", "start": 47.927, "end": 51.446}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The tank couldn't hold the pressure.", "start": 51.666, "end": 53.125}, {"beat": 5, "text": "When it burst, the molasses flowed fast, then cooled and thickened.", "start": 53.345, "end": 56.662}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That sticky goo trapped people before rescuers could pull them free.", "start": 56.882, "end": 60.15}, {"beat": 6, "text": "For decades after, Bostonians swore the North End still smelled of molasses on hot summer days.", "start": 60.57, "end": 65.703}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The tank was never rebuilt.", "start": 65.923, "end": 67.375}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "steel", "start": 0.245, "end": 0.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "tank", "start": 0.545, "end": 0.745, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "burst", "start": 0.795, "end": 1.27, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "and", "start": 1.345, "end": 1.42, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.445, "end": 1.47, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wall", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.695, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "of", "start": 1.72, "end": 1.77, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "syrup", "start": 1.82, "end": 2.12, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "swallowed", "start": 2.195, "end": 2.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 2.52, "end": 2.545, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Boston", "start": 2.595, "end": 2.97, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "street.", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.365, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "People", "start": 3.57, "end": 3.87, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 3.895, "end": 3.957, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "the", "start": 3.957, "end": 4.02, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "North", "start": 4.07, "end": 4.295, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "End", "start": 4.345, "end": 4.77, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "heard", "start": 4.87, "end": 5.02, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 5.045, "end": 5.095, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "roar", "start": 5.17, "end": 5.445, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "like", "start": 5.495, "end": 5.62, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "an", "start": 5.645, "end": 5.72, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "elevated", "start": 5.795, "end